Package: SigDoTS
Type: Package
Title: Hierarchical Significance Test for Spatial Domains
Version: 0.2.5.10
Authors@R: c(
    person("Huairui", "Wang", email = "byeah8887@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Feiyu", "Cao", role = "aut"),
    person("Hui", "Shen", role = "aut"),
    person("Yufeng", "Liu", role = "aut"),
    person("Guanao", "Yan", email = "gayan@msu.edu", role = "aut"))
Description: Tests, from the top of a tree of candidate spatial domains downwards, whether
    each proposed split of spots in a spatial transcriptomics sample is significant. The null
    model at each split has no domain structure but keeps the spatial correlation of the
    noise, estimated from pairs of spots within the same candidate domain.
